---

---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#E5E5E7] border-b border-slate-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-14 sm:mb-16">
      <span
        class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500 block mb-3"
      >
        WHAT TO EXPECT
      </span>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6"
      >
        Top level construction management
      </h2>

      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#ECECEE] border border-slate-300 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-900">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-900 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path d="M12 3v18"></path>
            <path d="M3 12h18"></path>
            <path d="M5 5h14v14H5z"></path>
          </svg>

          <h3
            class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Project management
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Efficient project management is the cornerstone of our construction
          process at Ardi Jaya, guaranteeing both quality control and adherence
          to budget constraints. Our adept project managers oversee every aspect
          of your project, from planning to execution, ensuring that goals are
          achievable and outcomes exceed expectations. Our skilled team delivers
          excellence at every stage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#ECECEE] border border-slate-300 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-900">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-900 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <circle cx="17" cy="9" r="3"></circle>
            <path d="M3 21c0-4 2-7 6-7s6 3 6 7"></path>
            <path d="M15 15c3 0 5 2 6 6"></path>
          </svg>

          <h3
            class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Collaboration
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Our teams are extremely skilled and experienced, and understand that
          collaboration is key to project success. Every project is, after all,
          a team effort. We work together with everyone involved and encourage
          collaborative working with all parties; including architects,
          designers and, of course, you. Our team approach is intrinsic to
          delivering projects as planned, keeping you updated throughout.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#ECECEE] border border-slate-300 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-900">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-900 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"></path>
            <path d="M8 8h8"></path>
            <path d="M8 12h8"></path>
            <path d="M8 16h5"></path>
          </svg>

          <h3
            class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Western standards
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Our commitment to quality is rooted in the extensive experience of our
          Western and local engineering management team, who collectively bring
          over half a century of construction expertise to every project. Our
          knowledge allows us to implement stringent Western standards in our
          work and ensure that every project adheres to these standards,
          delivering builds that are aesthetically stunning and built to last.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#ECECEE] border border-slate-300 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-none shadow-2xs space-y-4"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-900">
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-900 shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
            <path d="M5 4h14v16H5z"></path>
          </svg>

          <h3
            class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Attention to detail
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          We maintain a streamlined team and a carefully curated network of
          trusted partners, allowing us to focus on quality rather than rapid
          expansion. Consciously limiting our project intake ensures we never
          sacrifice precision for volume. This ensures that every project
          receives the focused attention it deserves, reflecting our passion for
          craftsmanship and unwavering dedication to excellence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
